@dc:title "Amplifier description bundle"
@dc:description "Packages the amplifier instance data for reasoning against the closed vocabulary bundle."
description bundle <https://leaphar06.github.io/amplifier-cross-reference-ontology/description-bundle#> as amplifier-dbundle {
    uses <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    uses <https://leaphar06.github.io/amplifier-cross-reference-ontology/vocabulary-bundle#>
    includes <https://leaphar06.github.io/amplifier-cross-reference-ontology/description#>
}